{"id":"oxcucay","qid":"Q2496969","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Oxçuçay","ru":"Вохчи","en":"Voghdji River"},"coordinates":[46.7197,39.03],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"serqi-zengezur","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q249252","az":"Zəngilan rayonu","en":"Zangilan District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Oxçuçay — Azərbaycan və Ermənistan ərazilərindən axan çay.\nOxçuçay Arazın sol qoludur. Ermənistan Qafan rayonu və Azərbaycanın Zəngilan rayonu ərazisindən keçir. Uzunluğu 85 km, hövzəsinin sahəsi 1140 km²-dir. Başlanğıcını Zəngəzur silsiləsinin Qapıcıq dağından (3285 m) götürür.\nAxımı qar (46%), yağış (10%) və yeraltı (44%) sulardan əmələ gəlir, su sərfi 8,90 kub m/san-dir. İllik axımının 40%-i yaz, 43%-i yay, 10%-i payız. 7%-i isə qış fəslində keçir.\nSuvarma işlərində istifadə olunur.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Вохчи́ (Охчи; арм. Ողջի) / Охчуча́й (Охчичай, Кафанчай, Капанчай; устар. Охчи-чай; азерб. Oxçuçay) — река, левый приток Аракса, протекает по территории Сюникской области Армении и Зангеланского района Азербайджана на юге Малого Кавказа.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Voghji (Armenian: Ողջի, romanized: Oġǰi) or Okchuchay (Azerbaijani: Oxçuçay) is a river on the south slopes of the Lesser Caucasus range, and is a left tributary of the Aras. It flows through the territory of Armenia and Azerbaijan.\nIn its upper reaches, the Voghji has formed a deep canyon which, near the city of Kapan, turns into a wide valley. It is fed by a range of sources.\nThe cities of Zangilan and Mincivan in Azerbaijan and Kajaran and Kapan in Armenia lie along the banks of the river.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Kapan_river_mot.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","small":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Kapan_river_mot.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kapan_river_mot.jpg","title":"Kapan river mot.jpg","artist":"en:User:Artaxiad","credit":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Image:Kapan_river_mot.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2496969: Voghdji River","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2496969","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Oxçuçay","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ox%C3%A7u%C3%A7ay&oldid=8898510","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ox%C3%A7u%C3%A7ay","revid":8898510,"revDate":"2026-05-18","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Вохчи (река)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%92%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%87%D0%B8_(%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%B0)&oldid=146008775","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%87%D0%B8_(%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%B0)","revid":146008775,"revDate":"2025-07-06","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Voghji (river)","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Voghji_(river)&oldid=1374573134","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voghji_(river)","revid":1374573134,"revDate":"2026-09-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Kapan river mot.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kapan_river_mot.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}